{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49860","headline":"虞美人 一 · 冯延巳","name":"虞美人 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉钩鸾柱调鹦鹉，宛转留春语。\n云屏冷落画堂空，薄晚春寒，无奈落花风。\n搴帘燕子低飞去，拂镜尘鸾舞。\n不知今夜月眉弯，谁佩同心双结，倚阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}